{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1197992-the-power-of-immagination-marvels-topic","id":1197992,"title":"The power of immagination (marvels topic)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-21T09:01:48-07:00","id":1197992,"title":"The power of immagination (marvels topic)","content":"Show me the greatness of your immagination performing some marvels examples!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T10:43:51-07:00","id":1198032,"title":"","content":"Echo, mute daughter of Zeus, has Deception as her innate purview, a Relic flashlight which grants her access to the Sky purview with the motif &quot;a rushing wind&quot;, and a Relic Polaroid camera which grants her access to the Artistry purview. As part of Artistry's effect, you can choose a specialty within Artistry, and you get a Motif as well, which she can use with any purview. She chooses Artistry (Photography), with the motif &quot;A picture is worth a thousand words.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Complication:</b><br /> Her band is apprehended leaving the headquarters of Cretan Creations, Inc. The CEO himself, James Minos, speaks to the officers, and says he wants to press charges. Echo snaps a photo of Minos backed by the police car, and hands it to him. As he looks at it, Echo imbues one point of Legend to impose the complication &quot;Conflicted&quot; on Minos.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><b>Conflicted</b><br /> <b>Effect: </b>The next time Minos attempts to lie, he suffers a 3-point Complication. If he fails to meet the level of the Complication, his lie is obvious and he turns suspicion on himself.</div> <br /> <br /> <b>Attacking:</b><br /> Later in the game, Minos sets the minotaur on the band. Echo spends a point of Legend, turns on the flashlight, points it at the monster, and starts snapping pictures. For the rest of the scene, her photographs are attacks with the keywords <b>Ranged, Pushing, Piercing</b>.Whenever he tries to stand, she knocks him back down.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23791-ashnak","name":"Ashnak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T16:21:48-07:00","id":1199525,"title":"","content":"Using a combination of the Health Purview and the Metamorphosis Purview I think my character could permanently augment a character in a way they wish. <br /> Change their natural hair colour, make them taller, or if they meet a someone who is Transgender I suppose my character can permanently change their physical sex to match that which they want.<br /> Not sure what difficulty it would take but I think a point of spent legend should cover it as that's already enough to change a person into an animal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4983-graywalker","name":"GrayWalker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4983_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T05:21:58-07:00","id":1199663,"title":"","content":"this is a nice idea.<br /> <br /> i'm in love with the idea of a shen using alchemy to play a elemental warrior","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T01:12:48-07:00","id":1199960,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking of making a Scion of Oduduwa, a former child soldier from Central Africa. He has innate War purview, and a group of followers, possibly fellow former soldiers.<br /> <br /> Was thinking of a marvel combining the PSP and War, summoning the ancestors of his followers, and allowing them to posses their descendants, granting them bonuses to combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1355-horvagab","name":"horvagab","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1355_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T05:35:34-07:00","id":1199992,"title":"","content":"As a simple, obvious, but fun option: Artistry (Music) and Fire would let you bring some awesome pyrotechnics to your shows!<br /> <br /> \u200bA more expensive possibility would probably be a Scion with the Windspeaker Staff (Purview: Sky. Motif: It calls the wind and weather.) spending a point of legend to throw out concussive wind blasts with the Bashing, Ranged, Pushing and Stun tags.<br /> <br /> \u200bA Netjer Scion with the War domain could pull a Djehuti by speaking items into being, at least long enough to use them, imbuing and reclaiming the Legend from moment to moment. &quot;Hand grenade!&quot; Boom! &quot;Assault rifle!&quot; Dakkadakka! &quot;Flamethrower! ...No? Too much? Okay, twelve-gauge shotgun with dragon's breath ammo!&quot; Click, boom!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12689,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12689-creepyshutin","user":"CreepyShutIn","date":". 03-27-2018, 08:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12689-creepyshutin","name":"CreepyShutIn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T07:18:08-07:00","id":1200025,"title":"","content":"With the netjer you can actually create a warlok with power words<br /> <br /> so cool","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}